descriptions.job-1ppmg6e:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a 12-week internship during summer 2027.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Design Intern, you&#39;ll spend 12 weeks embedded on a product team solving real design problems across Coinbase&#39;s core products including Coinbase app, Prime, Coinbase Wallet, and more. You&#39;ll partner with researchers, designers, product managers, and engineers to turn a product idea into a tangible user experience, contributing to large-scale design challenges that help millions of people engage with the crypto economy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a product design project end-to-end, translating a product concept into a polished user experience across mobile and/or web platforms with coaching from an intern manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with your product team and cross-functional stakeholders to define user needs, explore solutions, and validate design directions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead presentations of your work in group design critiques, incorporating feedback to strengthen your solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build high-fidelity prototypes in Figma to socialize design concepts and collaborate closely with engineering on implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineers to build and ship PRs using AI-assisted coding tools, translating your designs into production-ready front-end changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply human-centered design methods and structured problem-solving frameworks to navigate complex, ambiguous product challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to use design tools (Figma, Cursor, etc.) to create user flows, wireframes, or visual designs, evidenced by a portfolio or project samples&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Completed at least one design project (academic, personal, or professional) that shows end-to-end thinking from problem definition through visual execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic familiarity with cryptocurrency concepts and Coinbase&#39;s role in the ecosystem, with demonstrated curiosity to learn more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Req ID: P78017&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
