&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global vision, cross-industry cognition, understand the administrative difficulties and weakness of different businesses and countries, possesses professional administrative experience, analytical and problem-solving skills with good attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic planning, global administrative policy research and data analysis work experience, and strong logical thinking skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High EQ, stress tolerance, able to travel and work across time zones; optimistic and positive, good at project co-ordination and cooperation, with sense of the overall situation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor degree or above, more than eight years of overseas administrative management, working experience in medium to large ideally from internet/high-tech enterprises, knowledge of various office software and tools, proficiency in verbal and written English and Chinese.&lt;/li&gt;
